WEBVTT

00:42.083 --> 00:46.546
YOUTH DOCUMENTARY
OUR BELOVED SUMMER

00:48.506 --> 00:50.300
Do you remember these two

00:51.509 --> 00:54.345
from an early summer around ten years ago?

00:56.848 --> 00:59.809
Kook Yeon-su really exhausts people.

00:59.893 --> 01:01.895
Why does she live such an exhausting life?

01:01.978 --> 01:05.023
Early birds just get tired earlier.

01:05.106 --> 01:07.901
What on earth is he going to do
when he grows up?

01:07.984 --> 01:09.903
We can sleep all we want when we're dead.

01:10.612 --> 01:13.448
I'm certain now that he's going to be
lazy his whole life.

01:13.531 --> 01:15.658
These two young 19 year-olds

01:15.742 --> 01:19.621
became the center of attention,
creating a lot of meme-worthy moments.

01:20.205 --> 01:21.706
Were they "loved" by people?

01:21.790 --> 01:23.458
I enjoyed the documentary too.

01:24.042 --> 01:25.335
They were kind of

01:26.044 --> 01:27.378
really immature.

01:27.462 --> 01:29.672
At first, I thought it was only Ung.

01:29.756 --> 01:33.426
But now I think,
Yeon-su was more immature.

01:33.510 --> 01:34.552
No, actually,

01:35.386 --> 01:36.805
they're both a mess.

01:36.888 --> 01:37.847
Hey!

01:38.640 --> 01:41.059
Kook Yeon-su! You psycho!

01:41.142 --> 01:42.102
Damn it!

01:50.401 --> 01:51.736
I thought you were a ghost!

01:54.239 --> 01:55.573
It may seem so to you viewers,

01:55.657 --> 01:57.325
but in fact,
they weren't always bickering.

01:57.909 --> 02:00.912
They were bound to grow on each other
since they were always together.

02:01.579 --> 02:04.249
And I could feel
something else is there too.

02:04.332 --> 02:06.042
You get it, right?

02:06.126 --> 02:08.461
Anyway,
I figured it was quite intriguing.

02:08.545 --> 02:11.005
MORNING, AN ALLEYWAY IN HWIYEONG-DONG

02:11.089 --> 02:12.382
You're three minutes late.

02:13.466 --> 02:14.592
Just three minutes?

02:14.676 --> 02:16.719
That's like three years
to seniors like us.

02:17.512 --> 02:18.596
Don't be ridiculous.

02:18.680 --> 02:21.141
I now go to school
30 minutes earlier thanks to you.

02:21.224 --> 02:24.519
Exactly, that's the point.
I'm helping you save a lot of time.

02:24.602 --> 02:27.355
Gosh, do we have
to walk to school together?

02:29.190 --> 02:30.275
Hey.

02:35.280 --> 02:36.531
No, thanks.

02:36.614 --> 02:39.075
This isn't from me. It's from my mom.

02:39.159 --> 02:42.120
Do you even have breakfast
if you go to school this early?

02:44.414 --> 02:45.498
Thanks.

02:47.500 --> 02:48.585
Hey.

02:49.460 --> 02:51.546
Was it you who borrowed volume three?

02:51.629 --> 02:52.630
Yeah.

02:53.298 --> 02:54.883
Can you just let me read in peace here?

02:54.966 --> 02:56.676
Well, I'm a speedy reader.

02:56.759 --> 02:58.595
Can you let me read it first?

03:00.805 --> 03:02.015
Maybe that's why

03:02.640 --> 03:05.810
many people are wondering
how they're doing these past few days.

03:05.894 --> 03:07.645
WILL WE GET TO SEE THEM AGAIN
AFTER 10 YEARS?

03:07.729 --> 03:08.897
I don't know.

03:08.980 --> 03:11.774
I doubt it'll be that easy for us
to get them in front of the camera again.

03:11.858 --> 03:13.610
For one thing, many years have passed.

03:13.693 --> 03:17.238
And as you all know, they weren't…
weren't exactly on friendly terms.

03:17.322 --> 03:19.574
Plus, now that I think about it,

03:19.657 --> 03:22.619
I know it was tense. I know for a fact

03:22.702 --> 03:23.745
that they don't get along.

03:24.370 --> 03:25.747
Oh. Let's do a retake.

03:25.830 --> 03:28.041
Hmm, to be honest, I doubt it'll be easy.

03:28.124 --> 03:29.751
WHAT'S YOUR IDEAL TYPE?

03:29.834 --> 03:31.586
Someone who's super kind. I guess.

03:31.669 --> 03:35.131
Petite, adorable, with a round face.

03:35.215 --> 03:36.966
Someone who'll love me deeply.

03:37.050 --> 03:38.718
Someone I can always be with--

03:38.801 --> 03:40.386
You should just get a dog then.

03:41.596 --> 03:46.559
If I were to have a crush on someone,
he'd be the coolest person alive.

03:48.603 --> 03:50.897
We spent
that summer watching them.

03:52.440 --> 03:54.609
You might be wondering,
"How are they doing now?"

03:54.692 --> 03:56.819
- One thing's for sure…
- One thing I know for sure is that--

03:56.903 --> 03:59.364
…I'd have nothing to do
with this pathetic person beside me.

03:59.948 --> 04:02.033
That's exactly how I feel.

04:38.361 --> 04:44.200
EPISODE 12
BEGIN AGAIN

04:58.715 --> 05:00.383
How did you find out about it?

05:02.635 --> 05:03.970
Hmm…

05:05.263 --> 05:07.307
Everything seems to be a blur.

05:09.642 --> 05:11.185
I think I just came to know.

05:40.048 --> 05:41.799
The earliest memory

05:43.384 --> 05:46.304
I have was of that day.

05:47.805 --> 05:52.060
Every fall, around this time,
or to be exact, this day…

05:54.729 --> 05:56.147
Strangely,

05:57.148 --> 06:00.610
they're always sad on this day.

06:02.487 --> 06:05.114
Back then, I didn't know.

06:05.198 --> 06:06.741
I only realized it later.

06:11.037 --> 06:14.415
That's when I began
having those nightmares.

06:18.878 --> 06:19.754
Dad!

06:21.130 --> 06:22.924
Dad, where are you?

06:23.007 --> 06:25.968
Nightmares
I've been abandoned by someone.

06:26.052 --> 06:27.095
Dad!

06:32.308 --> 06:33.226
Worst of all,

06:34.060 --> 06:37.271
I didn't know who I was even looking for.

06:37.355 --> 06:40.191
- Hello.
- Yes, please come on in.

06:40.274 --> 06:41.317
Good morning.

06:41.401 --> 06:42.860
Thank you.

06:43.694 --> 06:46.030
- Ung! Good day to you.
- Come on in.

06:46.697 --> 06:49.075
Are you hungry, son?
Would you like me to make hotteok for you?

06:49.158 --> 06:51.244
But I knew

06:51.327 --> 06:53.162
- that I wasn't looking…
- Wait here.

06:53.246 --> 06:55.415
- …for my parents.
- Hello!

07:00.628 --> 07:01.963
That's all.

07:03.423 --> 07:04.465
There's not much to it.

07:06.843 --> 07:11.013
I guess I was lucky to have been adopted
by such great parents.

07:11.681 --> 07:12.849
Do any of them know?

07:13.933 --> 07:15.435
That I know about it?

07:16.978 --> 07:19.689
No. I didn't tell them.

07:26.404 --> 07:27.989
You must have been lonely.

07:34.078 --> 07:36.038
It must have broken your heart.

07:36.747 --> 07:39.041
How did you endure it all by yourself?

07:45.506 --> 07:47.675
I want to comfort you…

07:51.471 --> 07:53.723
but I don't know how to even help you.

07:57.310 --> 07:59.312
And I don't know what to say.

08:00.771 --> 08:01.981
You already have.

08:03.024 --> 08:04.442
Hmm?

08:04.525 --> 08:07.528
You're here by my side
and listening to my story.

08:08.654 --> 08:09.864
That's enough.

08:24.670 --> 08:25.838
Are you leaving already?

08:27.173 --> 08:28.174
Don't worry.

08:29.383 --> 08:31.135
I'll leave once you fall asleep.

08:33.763 --> 08:34.889
Mm.

08:38.059 --> 08:40.811
I really have trouble sleeping. You know?

08:41.521 --> 08:42.897
Hmm.

08:43.689 --> 08:45.024
But strange,

08:45.858 --> 08:47.610
I'm only able to sleep…

08:50.571 --> 08:52.573
when you are by my side.

08:57.745 --> 08:58.871
Yeon-su.

09:25.147 --> 09:27.858
- Ho!
- Oh, hey, Chang-sik.

09:27.942 --> 09:31.070
Oh, you acted like it won't be long,
but you closed down for days.

09:31.153 --> 09:33.030
I was bored to death, you know.

09:33.114 --> 09:35.116
Well, since we already went down there,

09:35.199 --> 09:37.952
we decided to stay longer
and look around a bit.

09:38.035 --> 09:39.662
What's gotten into you?

09:39.745 --> 09:41.664
You normally work
all year round, through the holidays.

09:41.747 --> 09:44.250
Oh, well you know, the weather was lovely.

09:44.333 --> 09:46.794
You should have taken me along with you.

09:46.877 --> 09:50.047
How could you go without me
when you knew I was all alone, huh?

09:50.131 --> 09:52.133
You hurt my feelings, you know.

09:53.134 --> 09:54.302
All right, Chang-sik.

09:54.969 --> 09:57.638
There's this term
kids nowadays like to use, see?

09:57.722 --> 10:00.141
It's called "B.I.B.O."

10:00.224 --> 10:01.601
"B.I." what now?

10:01.684 --> 10:03.728
Listen to me, it basically means
you should know

10:03.811 --> 10:06.522
when to butt in and butt out.
You understand, huh?

10:06.606 --> 10:08.733
Oh. So?

10:10.443 --> 10:14.864
Okay, you know what you are?
You are being a "B.I.B.I."

10:15.823 --> 10:18.701
- What do you mean?
- Oh gosh, you're so slow-witted.

10:18.784 --> 10:20.036
Just stop butting in! Got that?

10:20.119 --> 10:21.245
- Gosh.
- Hey, Dad.

10:21.329 --> 10:22.747
Oh, Ji-ung.

10:22.830 --> 10:24.957
- When'd you come back?
- We came back yesterday.

10:25.041 --> 10:27.752
Wait, just hold on.
Are you going to work already?

10:27.835 --> 10:29.503
- Actually, I'm coming from work.
- Huh?

10:29.587 --> 10:31.881
I need to get changed at home,
then head back.

10:31.964 --> 10:33.424
- Goodness.
- Are you still filming?

10:33.507 --> 10:36.677
I didn't get much screen time lately.
So, don't you need me?

10:36.761 --> 10:38.471
- Oh, jeez.
- We're done filming.

10:38.554 --> 10:41.557
- We had our final shoot several days ago.
- Oh, congratulations.

10:41.641 --> 10:45.019
I bet Ung was quite difficult
to deal with. Thank you for everything.

10:45.102 --> 10:47.104
But why in the world did you cast Ung?

10:47.188 --> 10:49.607
That boy is so quiet and boring as hell.
I really don't--

10:49.690 --> 10:51.901
I'm sure Ji-ung has his reasons.

10:51.984 --> 10:53.903
You really have no clue, do you?

10:53.986 --> 10:57.823
Do you have any idea
how popular my son really is right now?

10:57.907 --> 11:00.117
I'm asking you, Chang-sik.
Do you have any idea?

11:00.201 --> 11:02.161
- No need to yell.
- Answer me right now.

11:02.244 --> 11:06.040
All right, fine.
Jeez, no need to snap at me.

11:06.582 --> 11:10.127
So, Ji-ung. Now that you're done,
what will you be filming next, huh?

11:10.211 --> 11:12.338
If this is getting aired on TV…

11:12.421 --> 11:15.466
…you should film my hardware store
and tell everyone

11:15.549 --> 11:19.178
that we sell a ton of great tools.
The kind that…

11:19.261 --> 11:21.097
Ow! Stop that, will you?

11:21.180 --> 11:22.723
Ignore him. Please ignore him.

11:22.807 --> 11:24.183
You must be feeling tired.

11:24.266 --> 11:27.019
If you've been working
right up until now, Ji-ung, then

11:27.103 --> 11:28.688
doesn't that mean you stayed up all night?

11:28.771 --> 11:30.606
Oh, no, I slept a bit at work.

11:30.690 --> 11:34.360
If I'm filming anything interesting again,
I'll make sure to let you know.

11:34.443 --> 11:36.195
- Sure. Okay.
- Well, I should get going.

11:36.278 --> 11:38.572
- Oh, go on then. Come by for a meal later.
- I will.

11:38.656 --> 11:40.157
Okay. Bye.

11:40.908 --> 11:42.410
What a well-mannered kid.

11:43.077 --> 11:46.747
So different from yours,
but their names are similar.

11:46.831 --> 11:47.790
Don't you need to go?

11:54.046 --> 11:55.214
Hey, what is it?

11:56.924 --> 11:58.217
No, I'm fine.

11:59.677 --> 12:02.263
I just went home
to get a change of clothes. Hmm.

12:04.348 --> 12:06.642
No, it's fine. Set it up. I'll be there.

12:07.393 --> 12:08.394
Hmm.

12:43.971 --> 12:46.056
Are you expecting a call from someone?

12:46.140 --> 12:47.516
What? No.

12:47.600 --> 12:50.478
Then hurry up and dig in already.

12:50.561 --> 12:51.812
All right, fine.

13:07.661 --> 13:10.539
Hey, watch it! It's dripping on the floor!

13:11.582 --> 13:12.833
Wasn't it my phone?

13:12.917 --> 13:13.918
No, it's mine.

13:17.880 --> 13:19.590
What's with her?

13:21.050 --> 13:22.885
I'm leaving now, grandma.

13:35.564 --> 13:38.901
I can always just call him first
after all. It's no big deal.

13:44.532 --> 13:46.534
What if he just fell asleep?

13:49.995 --> 13:52.957
Or maybe he might still be up right now.

14:02.258 --> 14:04.051
Oh.

14:04.134 --> 14:05.386
You're here.

14:06.011 --> 14:07.012
When did you arrive?

14:07.972 --> 14:09.056
You should have called.

14:09.932 --> 14:11.517
I came after work.

14:12.268 --> 14:14.061
Do you leave for work at this hour?

14:14.144 --> 14:16.397
I would have left sooner
if you told me you'd come.

14:17.064 --> 14:18.190
So, did you get some sleep?

14:20.901 --> 14:22.444
No, I wasn't sleepy.

14:23.028 --> 14:26.699
Hey. You need to stop staying up
all night just because you're not sleepy.

14:26.782 --> 14:28.075
Have you been drinking jujube tea?

14:28.158 --> 14:29.785
You should still try to sleep you know.

14:29.869 --> 14:32.288
How can you fall asleep
when you're out and about?

14:32.371 --> 14:34.915
You're not going to take
some sleeping pills now, are you?

14:34.999 --> 14:38.502
I told you before, those pills
aren't good for you in the long run.

14:38.586 --> 14:40.671
You may not go cold turkey,
but you should still try--

14:40.754 --> 14:41.672
Are you done?

14:43.299 --> 14:48.012
I'm just saying that you should've
stayed home and tried to sleep instead.

14:49.054 --> 14:51.557
I'd rather be here right now.

14:53.809 --> 14:56.353
What's that face? Are you happy or not?

14:57.563 --> 14:58.731
I'm feeling ecstatic.

14:59.940 --> 15:02.318
Then you should've just said so
from the get-go.

15:02.401 --> 15:04.111
Let's go. I'll drive you.

15:04.695 --> 15:06.530
You mean to work? I can just take the bus.

15:06.614 --> 15:08.198
It's quicker by car.

15:08.282 --> 15:09.617
Hey. You shouldn't be driving

15:09.700 --> 15:11.452
- when you haven't slept a wink. That's--
- Hey.

15:11.535 --> 15:13.120
There you go again.

15:13.203 --> 15:15.122
But at least
let me drive you to the bus stop.

15:15.205 --> 15:16.540
Is that fine?

15:16.624 --> 15:18.250
Hmm. That's fine.

15:19.418 --> 15:22.004
Why is it that you nag me
every time I say something?

15:22.087 --> 15:24.298
It's only because you keep worrying me.

15:24.381 --> 15:25.299
I'm not a kid.

15:25.382 --> 15:27.426
Exactly. So when will you grow up, Ung?

15:38.771 --> 15:41.190
And when will you grow up, Kook Yeon-su?

15:46.904 --> 15:48.489
You think you can ditch work today?

15:50.824 --> 15:52.326
Forget it.

15:52.409 --> 15:55.329
Come on. Just one day will be fine.

15:55.412 --> 15:57.331
I can't just skip work.

15:57.414 --> 15:59.833
And there's no need
for you to drop me off.

15:59.917 --> 16:01.377
Just go home and sleep.

16:01.877 --> 16:03.712
But you said I could.

16:03.796 --> 16:06.048
I changed my mind, don't follow me.

16:11.762 --> 16:12.930
Hey, Choi Ung.

16:13.555 --> 16:15.307
I have a question to ask you.

16:16.266 --> 16:17.601
So, are we dating again?

16:18.477 --> 16:20.396
Did you think we weren't all this time?

16:21.105 --> 16:23.691
I mean, I just wanted to be sure.

16:25.109 --> 16:26.610
I thought it couldn't be more obvious.

16:29.530 --> 16:30.572
Ung.

16:32.783 --> 16:34.868
I hope we get along.

16:38.872 --> 16:40.457
He's so straightforward.

16:42.209 --> 16:43.627
She's so adorable.

17:00.936 --> 17:04.273
- Are you going to keep staring?
- Do you have good news or something?

17:04.773 --> 17:06.692
- Why?
- Well,

17:07.276 --> 17:10.029
I'm not really sure
as to what's gotten into you now,

17:10.112 --> 17:12.489
but you've been coming here to eat often.

17:13.657 --> 17:14.950
So how did your trip go?

17:15.034 --> 17:18.912
Hmm, good. We enjoyed
the autumn leaves on our way home.

17:18.996 --> 17:20.497
We took a lot of photos too.

17:20.998 --> 17:22.124
Look.

17:23.375 --> 17:26.295
Look at this. Isn't it beautiful?

17:26.378 --> 17:28.088
Yes, it sure is.

17:28.964 --> 17:31.633
Resting certainly
made me want to take a longer break.

17:32.176 --> 17:34.970
You think we should just
close down the restaurants for good?

17:35.054 --> 17:36.972
I've been telling you to do that.

17:37.056 --> 17:39.349
Just enjoy and spend your S.C.

17:40.017 --> 17:41.852
S.C? What is that?

17:41.935 --> 17:42.895
"Son's card."

17:42.978 --> 17:46.732
Ooh! That sounds lovely.

17:48.942 --> 17:50.527
You should have brought me along too.

17:51.945 --> 17:52.821
With us?

17:54.823 --> 17:56.909
You don't really like the countryside.

17:56.992 --> 17:58.869
And we thought you'd be busy.

18:00.537 --> 18:01.830
No. It's okay.

18:03.123 --> 18:05.626
I'm really fine, mom.
There's always next time.

18:07.836 --> 18:09.838
Okay. We will.

18:12.091 --> 18:14.134
Hey, Ung, my boy.

18:14.802 --> 18:17.930
I heard that you're done
filming the documentary.

18:18.013 --> 18:19.348
Is that true?

18:20.432 --> 18:22.351
Isn't it about time
that you stayed with us again

18:22.434 --> 18:25.354
and went back to being
the restaurant's cashier?

18:25.437 --> 18:30.859
Ho, Ung here told me to quit
and just use my S.C.

18:30.943 --> 18:32.820
S.C? What's and S.C?

18:32.903 --> 18:34.988
Don't you know? It's "son's card."

18:35.072 --> 18:38.242
What? Hey, son. What about me?

18:38.325 --> 18:41.078
You should do something
that's even better and more popular.

18:41.161 --> 18:42.121
And what is that?

18:42.204 --> 18:43.539
M.A.L.F.Y.

18:43.622 --> 18:45.999
M.A.L.F.Y?

18:46.083 --> 18:49.211
- Is that something better?
- Of course. It's so much better.

18:49.753 --> 18:51.672
It means, "Making a life for yourself."

18:54.049 --> 18:55.008
Thanks for the meal.

18:55.092 --> 18:57.302
- Be sure to come by for dinner too.
- "Making…"

18:57.386 --> 18:59.930
- I'll make dumpling soup.
- Please, don't tempt me with food.

19:00.013 --> 19:03.100
That's the only way I can bring you here.

19:04.059 --> 19:05.435
Wait. "Making a…"

19:10.149 --> 19:12.276
- Mr. Park.
- Oh, Tae-hun, what?

19:12.359 --> 19:15.320
- Where are your seniors right now?
- They're in a meeting with Ms. Lee.

19:15.404 --> 19:16.738
How was the filming?

19:17.406 --> 19:20.033
Mr. Choi and Ms. Kook
were interviewed in the last part.

19:20.826 --> 19:21.827
Uhm…

19:22.327 --> 19:23.370
What?

19:24.538 --> 19:27.291
Well, it was rather strange.
They didn't even look at each other.

19:27.374 --> 19:29.042
No, not them.

19:29.126 --> 19:32.212
You know, did anything interesting happen?

19:32.296 --> 19:35.174
You know, between Chae-ran and Ji-ung.

19:35.257 --> 19:37.176
Please don't ask about them anymore.

19:37.259 --> 19:39.261
I don't think it's right
to tell of it, sir.

19:39.970 --> 19:43.182
- Say what?
- Also, if you keep asking me about them

19:43.265 --> 19:45.601
because you think
they have feelings for each other,

19:45.684 --> 19:47.477
then I definitely can't say anything.

19:47.561 --> 19:51.356
I don't think it's right to suspect
your colleagues of doing things like that.

19:51.440 --> 19:53.066
Also, why do you think

19:53.150 --> 19:56.111
Ms. Jung and Mr. Kim
have something going on between them, sir?

19:56.695 --> 19:59.448
They're hardworking people
who are only focused on…

20:00.908 --> 20:02.201
M… Ms… Ms. Jung.

20:04.578 --> 20:07.331
Is this really
what you've been up to recently?

20:08.332 --> 20:11.084
Hmm? What? Me?

20:13.629 --> 20:17.716
Oh, him?
He always stands there and rambles on.

20:17.799 --> 20:20.552
I thought he was just practicing
for some sort of speech.

20:20.636 --> 20:22.679
- Why are you here anyway?
- What?

20:22.763 --> 20:24.556
You have too much
time on your hands, don't you?

20:24.640 --> 20:26.350
I always let you go home early,

20:26.433 --> 20:28.352
but I guess you have
nothing better to do with your energy.

20:28.435 --> 20:30.145
No, Ms. Jung. That isn't true--

20:30.229 --> 20:32.064
It seems I won't be lenient
with you anymore.

20:32.731 --> 20:34.358
You're pulling an all-nighter.

20:35.817 --> 20:36.944
Hello?

20:37.027 --> 20:39.363
Uh… Ms… Ms. Jung, I…

20:39.446 --> 20:40.489
- Hello?
- Mr. Park.

20:40.572 --> 20:42.074
- Mr. Park.
- Yes?

21:05.806 --> 21:07.057
Are we ready yet?

21:07.140 --> 21:08.141
Yes.

21:14.648 --> 21:18.235
Oh, right. Can I ask,
what was the last question again?

21:18.318 --> 21:20.320
The last question
we asked you is,

21:20.404 --> 21:22.406
"What will you be doing
ten years from now?"

21:50.892 --> 21:53.020
- Ji-ung, are you okay?
- What?

21:53.103 --> 21:55.689
You didn't look too good
during the meeting earlier.

21:55.772 --> 21:58.025
You've been pulling too many
all-nighters recently,

21:58.108 --> 22:01.194
- so how about you go home for tonight.
- I'm fine.

22:02.321 --> 22:05.824
You really don't look fine.
I think you should go home for tonight.

22:05.907 --> 22:07.701
You look like you could faint.

22:07.784 --> 22:09.828
It's better to faint over here
than at home.

22:10.537 --> 22:12.289
What?

22:12.372 --> 22:13.707
Never mind.

22:13.790 --> 22:16.877
If I get too exhausted,
I'll go home, so don't you worry.

22:28.847 --> 22:31.725
Look at you.
You're running a fever here, Ji-ung!

22:31.808 --> 22:32.851
This won't do. Get up from there.

22:32.934 --> 22:35.812
- I'm really fine.
- I'm kicking you out. Now go.

22:35.896 --> 22:37.064
Hey.

22:37.147 --> 22:38.982
- Hey.
- Go on.

22:40.192 --> 22:42.486
I'll be using this room tonight.
And you're not allowed in.

22:43.362 --> 22:44.863
Hey? What's going on?

22:45.572 --> 22:46.698
He's going home right now.

22:46.782 --> 22:49.659
He's running a fever,
so he might get us sick too.

22:50.160 --> 22:51.828
- Hey, come on. It's not that bad.
- What is it?

22:52.704 --> 22:54.247
The flu?

22:54.331 --> 22:55.916
Go home, okay?

22:55.999 --> 23:00.587
I suffered from a terrible flu last time.
Stop bothering her, just leave!

23:00.670 --> 23:02.172
Now, get home safe.

23:03.882 --> 23:06.218
Why is she overreacting all of a sudden?

23:07.052 --> 23:10.806
Hey, Ji-ung. Don't you think
she's just worried about you?

23:10.889 --> 23:13.475
You know, you're really slow-witted, huh?

23:13.558 --> 23:14.893
Just go home.

23:15.477 --> 23:16.436
And don't upset her.

23:17.020 --> 23:18.188
What do you mean?

23:20.941 --> 23:24.027
I mean, she… she hasn't been able
to go home ever since

23:24.111 --> 23:26.154
you started pulling all-nighters in here.

23:26.738 --> 23:29.991
Oh, but… but I told her
she could go home first.

23:30.075 --> 23:32.035
Does she still feel bad about that?

23:32.953 --> 23:35.122
Do you seriously think that's why?

23:36.957 --> 23:40.001
You know what?
Forget it. You're a lost cause.

23:40.085 --> 23:41.253
How frustrating.

23:43.338 --> 23:45.048
So frustrating.

23:59.771 --> 24:01.022
Who would drink this?

24:24.045 --> 24:26.173
What in the world is wrong with him, huh?

24:30.260 --> 24:31.553
Gosh, that's hot.

24:32.387 --> 24:35.474
Will you please focus for a minute?
We have so much to do today.

24:37.517 --> 24:39.728
They published the interview
you did last time.

24:41.688 --> 24:42.689
Now, let's see.

24:43.648 --> 24:46.776
They would like to use
some of your drawings for the documentary.

24:46.860 --> 24:50.238
Should I pick them out myself?
Or will you talk to Ji-ung about it?

24:51.823 --> 24:54.201
Well? Give it some thought.

24:55.076 --> 24:58.413
Oh, by the way, I haven't seen him
ever since the filming ended.

24:58.497 --> 24:59.581
Is he that busy?

24:59.664 --> 25:01.708
Also, the gallery just called.

25:01.791 --> 25:03.460
You wanted to see
the night lighting, right?

25:03.543 --> 25:05.754
Well, they said you could come today.
So shall we go?

25:05.837 --> 25:08.632
No. Not today.

25:09.216 --> 25:10.383
I have something to do.

25:11.051 --> 25:12.302
Is it another drawing?

25:16.348 --> 25:19.059
Then Ye-in will be in charge
of the online marketing.

25:19.142 --> 25:20.352
Myeong-ho, please help her.

25:20.435 --> 25:21.811
- Okay.
- Okay.

25:21.895 --> 25:24.898
I think you've all become too lax
after finishing a big project.

25:24.981 --> 25:27.609
We still have one big project
in the second half of the year.

25:27.692 --> 25:29.444
So I'd like us to focus on that.

25:29.528 --> 25:30.737
- Okay.
- Okay.

25:30.820 --> 25:32.489
That'll be all. Good work, everyone.

25:43.708 --> 25:46.628
Would you like
to have dinner together later?

25:52.133 --> 25:54.135
I left my pen behind.

26:04.813 --> 26:07.148
Something came up.
So I'm afraid I can't.

26:07.232 --> 26:10.485
Really? Wasn't he the one
who asked me to ditch work?

26:12.988 --> 26:14.155
Is he sulking?

26:16.074 --> 26:17.367
Why?

26:19.119 --> 26:20.328
What came up?

26:22.789 --> 26:24.082
Are you sulking…

26:26.793 --> 26:27.752
Okay.

26:44.102 --> 26:46.438
This place never feels welcoming.

26:56.489 --> 26:58.825
I'll just rest for a minute.

27:20.180 --> 27:22.557
The person
you're calling is unavailable…

27:50.835 --> 27:53.171
The person
you're calling is unavailable…

28:16.861 --> 28:18.029
Why are you…

28:18.738 --> 28:19.781
You have a fever.

28:27.205 --> 28:28.540
It's bearable.

28:29.999 --> 28:33.378
You're right.
It actually doesn't seem that bad.

28:34.421 --> 28:35.547
When'd you get here?

28:35.630 --> 28:36.840
A while ago.

28:37.507 --> 28:40.009
I had to learn how to stuff a pill
through a sleeping man's throat.

28:40.635 --> 28:42.512
What a bummer. Take this.

28:49.477 --> 28:52.939
How come your place has no human's warmth?

28:54.524 --> 28:55.817
I'm not human, am I?

28:58.820 --> 29:00.196
Why are you sick?

29:03.533 --> 29:05.076
What kind of question is that?

29:05.160 --> 29:07.996
I mean, you've always been proud
of your health.

29:08.079 --> 29:09.956
So I can't help but feel curious.

29:11.040 --> 29:13.960
What did you do to get sick like this

29:14.043 --> 29:16.171
and throw a pity party for yourself?

29:18.214 --> 29:19.299
Nothing much.

29:20.383 --> 29:22.469
I just pulled
a few all-nighters. That's all.

29:23.470 --> 29:25.013
I'm going back to bed.

29:25.096 --> 29:26.473
I won't see you out.

29:35.940 --> 29:37.275
You look like you have something to say.

29:38.735 --> 29:39.903
Mm.

29:41.404 --> 29:42.447
But…

29:43.323 --> 29:46.743
I'm not sure if I should
since you're sick right now.

30:01.841 --> 30:03.635
Then can I not hear it?

30:04.928 --> 30:06.304
Yeon-su and I are dating again.

30:09.432 --> 30:11.476
So I had no choice in the end.

30:15.939 --> 30:18.691
Okay. Why are you telling me this?

30:21.027 --> 30:23.822
Just because,
I've always wanted to tell you first.

30:24.405 --> 30:26.741
It's been that way both
in the past and the present.

30:31.746 --> 30:33.957
I got a girlfriend.

30:38.378 --> 30:39.921
And yet once again,

30:41.130 --> 30:42.507
I have nothing to say.

30:45.885 --> 30:47.470
Should I congratulate you then?

30:49.848 --> 30:50.807
No, that's okay.

30:53.268 --> 30:54.519
Now, if there's nothing else

30:56.312 --> 30:58.940
- can I go back to bed?
- Mm.

31:04.237 --> 31:05.405
One more thing.

31:05.488 --> 31:06.614
Hmm?

31:07.866 --> 31:09.826
Can you please get lost?

31:11.661 --> 31:12.954
Mm.

31:28.052 --> 31:29.012
Oh!

31:48.197 --> 31:50.074
Yes, hello?

31:50.158 --> 31:51.951
Mm, are you up?

31:52.035 --> 31:52.994
Yeah.

31:54.537 --> 31:57.790
I woke up a while ago.
I'm about to go out.

31:58.291 --> 32:00.376
And you? Did you not sleep again?

32:00.460 --> 32:02.086
No, I slept a bit.

32:05.089 --> 32:08.509
Uh… and breakfast.
Did you get to eat anything?

32:08.593 --> 32:10.178
Have some, then go to bed.

32:10.845 --> 32:11.930
Okay.

32:13.389 --> 32:14.724
Are you going to work?

32:14.807 --> 32:16.726
Mm-hmm. Yes, I am.

32:17.310 --> 32:18.353
I see.

32:18.436 --> 32:19.687
That's right.

32:23.316 --> 32:25.777
Well, what are you doing this weekend?

32:25.860 --> 32:27.236
This weekend?

32:27.320 --> 32:28.821
Mm-hmm, thi… this weekend.

32:29.405 --> 32:31.199
Do you want to hang out if you're free?

32:31.282 --> 32:33.826
Uh… This weekend…

32:33.910 --> 32:35.954
But if you're too busy, it's okay.

32:36.037 --> 32:39.916
No. I'm free this weekend.
Yeah. Let's meet.

32:40.625 --> 32:41.834
Hmm. Okay.

32:43.127 --> 32:44.420
Okay.

32:44.504 --> 32:47.840
I think I should get to work now.
I'm hanging up.

32:47.924 --> 32:48.967
Okay.

32:53.388 --> 32:56.391
Oh. Why do I feel so awkward?

32:57.809 --> 33:00.311
Just be yourself, Yeon-su. Okay?

33:01.062 --> 33:04.649
Maybe I shouldn't have asked him out.

33:10.947 --> 33:13.324
Gosh. It feels so awkward.

33:16.202 --> 33:17.745
What are you doing?

33:19.580 --> 33:21.374
- What?
- Aren't you going to work?

33:21.457 --> 33:24.460
I… I am. I'm leaving right now.

33:33.344 --> 33:36.097
She's been acting
so weird since yesterday.

33:36.806 --> 33:37.932
Hold on.

33:38.766 --> 33:40.309
I have a weird feeling.

33:49.402 --> 33:51.779
When was the last time
we talked on the phone?

33:51.863 --> 33:53.156
Should I call her again?

33:53.823 --> 33:55.199
No, I shouldn't.

33:57.493 --> 34:00.246
Gosh, what's going on here?
Is this water park now?

34:01.956 --> 34:03.332
Oh!

34:04.167 --> 34:06.878
Where's your head at?
Are you still asleep?

34:07.670 --> 34:10.131
This'll be a pain. Good luck.

34:10.214 --> 34:13.092
- Wait, can you clean this?
- But…

34:14.385 --> 34:15.678
I didn't come here to clean.

34:15.762 --> 34:17.180
Oh, come on!

34:17.263 --> 34:19.766
I'm your manager, not your errand guy.

34:21.017 --> 34:25.438
I mean, I did ask him out first,
but he sounded kind of reluctant.

34:25.521 --> 34:27.899
It's like he didn't seem
too excited about it.

34:27.982 --> 34:29.567
So, did he refuse you?

34:30.151 --> 34:31.527
Uh, no, he didn't.

34:32.070 --> 34:34.614
Even so,
it keeps bothering me for some reason.

34:34.697 --> 34:36.574
Did he feel forced to go out with me?

34:36.657 --> 34:38.034
But the date is still on.

34:38.117 --> 34:41.037
What? Did you expect him
to be all ecstatic about it?

34:41.120 --> 34:43.164
Hey, you're not
teenagers anymore, you know?

34:43.247 --> 34:46.834
But still. It was so unlike him
to react that way.

34:47.335 --> 34:48.419
He's so weird.

34:48.503 --> 34:50.588
Do you know what
the weirdest thing is right now?

34:50.671 --> 34:51.756
What is it?

34:51.839 --> 34:54.634
It's the fact that
you were the one who called me first.

34:55.384 --> 34:57.678
You were the one
who made the effort to call me

34:57.762 --> 34:59.806
while you're still in the middle of work.

35:00.640 --> 35:03.017
I'm not at work. I'm driving to work.

35:03.101 --> 35:04.685
You used to be such a rude brat

35:04.769 --> 35:08.397
who'd tell me to be brief with my call
since you were driving.

35:08.481 --> 35:10.274
But now you called me first,

35:10.358 --> 35:12.985
and here you are
rambling to me about Choi Ung.

35:13.569 --> 35:15.696
Well, that's because--

35:15.780 --> 35:18.157
Okay. Who do you think
is the one who has changed?

35:18.741 --> 35:21.744
Go on, who's the weirder one here?
Try to guess.

35:21.828 --> 35:25.081
Anyway, stop worrying over it.
Just follow your heart.

35:25.665 --> 35:27.583
I mean, it took you this long
to get back together.

35:27.667 --> 35:31.379
So stop hesitating
and step up already. I'm hanging up.

35:31.462 --> 35:34.423
Wait, what? I can't believe I said that.

35:34.507 --> 35:37.677
Hang up! Hang up already!

35:38.719 --> 35:41.222
That felt so nice.

35:41.806 --> 35:43.933
What an adorable, little brat.

35:44.016 --> 35:46.727
Why have I become so timid?

35:50.022 --> 35:52.525
Has dating always been this difficult?

36:03.244 --> 36:04.453
What's going on?

36:04.537 --> 36:06.414
Ung and Yeon-su
are going out again.

36:06.497 --> 36:08.082
- Are you serious?
- Mm-hmm.

36:11.169 --> 36:14.714
Why did they hesitate for so long
if they were going to get back together?

36:19.802 --> 36:21.596
- So how do you feel?
- Hmm?

36:21.679 --> 36:25.099
I know that you don't really like him.

36:25.183 --> 36:27.435
Oh, my opinion doesn't matter.

36:27.518 --> 36:29.770
She likes him, so what can I even say?

36:31.480 --> 36:34.400
I still have my doubts.
What if he's not a healthy boy?

36:35.067 --> 36:36.944
I'm pretty sure he is.

36:37.987 --> 36:40.948
Yet again, I am concerned
about his mental health.

36:42.283 --> 36:43.284
He's a bit…

36:44.410 --> 36:48.456
Never mind. Anyway, I'll keep an eye
on them. So don't you worry about a thing.

36:50.041 --> 36:53.211
Or should I fix her up with another man?

36:53.294 --> 36:54.837
I mean, there are still

36:54.921 --> 36:57.840
plenty of wonderful candidates
out there, you know.

36:58.507 --> 37:01.719
Oh no, it's okay.
Don't bother. Leave her be.

37:01.802 --> 37:02.929
Eat this.

37:03.512 --> 37:05.097
It's fine.

37:05.181 --> 37:06.474
You must actually like him, huh?

37:06.557 --> 37:09.769
Not at all. Why would I like
that good-for-nothing boy?

37:10.353 --> 37:12.396
Then what are you waiting for?

37:13.147 --> 37:15.191
I should find her a good man

37:15.274 --> 37:17.818
before I get older and it's too late.

37:18.444 --> 37:21.197
I don't have much time left. Yes.

37:21.864 --> 37:24.116
I have to see him again while I still can.

37:24.200 --> 37:26.869
The building is quite large
and there are many shops here.

37:26.953 --> 37:27.954
I see.

37:29.372 --> 37:31.958
- It looks like it's three stories tall.
- That's right.

37:36.295 --> 37:37.546
It would certainly be nice

37:37.630 --> 37:39.674
if you could take
plenty of videos in this area.

37:40.841 --> 37:43.511
In fact, the sunset
looks quite beautiful from up here.

37:43.594 --> 37:45.054
Oh, I see. I'll let them know.

37:45.137 --> 37:46.722
Do you have any other requests?

37:47.306 --> 37:50.476
Hmm. I'm sure that you'll do
a great job with everything else.

37:51.185 --> 37:52.728
Let me check the time.

37:53.312 --> 37:55.147
You can actually see the sunset right now.

37:55.231 --> 37:57.191
You can take a look around
with your colleague.

37:57.275 --> 37:58.943
Oh. I'm here alone today.

37:59.026 --> 38:00.444
But I'll drop by
with them again next time.

38:01.654 --> 38:03.364
I thought you came with him.

38:05.574 --> 38:07.201
He's been there all along.

38:08.661 --> 38:10.162
- Ma'am.
- Oh, yes?

38:27.179 --> 38:28.556
I have forgotten…

38:44.238 --> 38:45.740
What are you doing here?

38:46.907 --> 38:48.451
…that the person I loved…

38:49.660 --> 38:51.203
Are you here to see me?

38:53.080 --> 38:55.791
Why did you want to meet on the weekend?

38:57.001 --> 38:58.169
What?

38:59.378 --> 39:00.546
I can't

39:01.672 --> 39:02.631
wait that long.

39:03.549 --> 39:06.344
Whether he was
the same person or not…

39:06.427 --> 39:08.929
Go on. I won't get in your way.

39:10.973 --> 39:12.641
I didn't know about this place.

39:13.476 --> 39:15.811
I should hold my exhibition here someday.

39:20.358 --> 39:21.525
Oh.

39:22.693 --> 39:23.694
It's Ung.

39:24.195 --> 39:26.489
I just loved him for who he is.

39:34.997 --> 39:37.792
It won't take long.
Just wait here a little.

39:45.049 --> 39:47.051
I was right.

39:48.260 --> 39:49.762
It is too far away.

39:54.475 --> 39:56.519
- Isn't it wonderful?
- Yes.

39:56.602 --> 39:58.437
- I think you should cover this place too.
- Okay.

39:58.521 --> 40:01.941
Over here is the pottery exhibition.
You wanna check it out?

40:06.195 --> 40:09.782
We've installed shelves by the walls,
so that the children can approach them.

40:09.865 --> 40:12.618
There's are more exhibition halls
upstairs, follow me. This way.

40:25.381 --> 40:27.425
EDITING ROOM

40:37.226 --> 40:39.937
Ji-ung, are you certain that
you're feeling much better now?

40:40.020 --> 40:43.149
Hmm. You took
my temperature earlier, right?

40:44.692 --> 40:47.403
Are you happy about something?

40:48.529 --> 40:49.655
No.

40:55.369 --> 40:57.121
Can we use a different insert for this?

40:57.204 --> 40:59.915
Uh… Yes. I'll find you one.

41:03.961 --> 41:05.129
Thank you.

41:17.641 --> 41:19.393
HOT AND SAVORY ROASTED CHESTNUTS

41:34.742 --> 41:35.993
This feels like

41:36.619 --> 41:38.454
we're already on a date.

41:42.374 --> 41:45.878
It finally feels like
we're in a relationship again.

41:50.633 --> 41:51.926
It took a while,

41:53.010 --> 41:53.886
didn't it?

42:05.898 --> 42:07.441
Darn these corn dogs.

42:09.652 --> 42:11.862
- Can you hold this for me?
- No way.

42:12.530 --> 42:13.656
Okay, then.

42:35.386 --> 42:37.179
Do you want a corn dog?

42:42.226 --> 42:44.103
- Let's go.
- It looks tasty.

42:45.771 --> 42:47.606
BEGIN AGAIN

42:51.819 --> 42:53.112
Mr. Kim.

42:54.363 --> 42:56.574
Hey, what was that about? You just saw me.

42:56.657 --> 42:59.451
- Were you really just going to walk by?
- What brings you here?

42:59.535 --> 43:01.579
You know I'm doing a special documentary.

43:03.038 --> 43:05.040
Is Mr. Choi done with his part?

43:05.124 --> 43:08.043
How's it going?
I'm really looking forward to watching it.

43:08.127 --> 43:10.963
We're done with the shooting already,
and we're editing it right now.

43:11.046 --> 43:12.047
Will you use my footage too?

43:13.173 --> 43:15.384
By the way, how is Mr. Choi doing?

43:15.467 --> 43:18.387
Is he still busy even after the shoot,

43:18.470 --> 43:20.389
or is he just
pretending to be at the moment?

43:20.472 --> 43:22.766
I can't seem to ever reach him.

43:33.444 --> 43:36.113
Mr. Kim, is that your dinner?

43:36.196 --> 43:38.490
That won't fill you up,
you know. Chi-seong.

43:38.574 --> 43:40.409
Oh. Goodbye. Yes?

43:40.492 --> 43:41.577
Am I done for today?

43:41.660 --> 43:44.913
Hmm. I thought
you were going to head home.

43:44.997 --> 43:47.541
I'm going to have dinner
with Mr. Kim over there.

43:47.625 --> 43:48.959
You two?

43:49.543 --> 43:52.880
What do you say?
I have some things to ask you anyway.

43:52.963 --> 43:55.174
I was just gonna have
a light meal while editing.

43:56.342 --> 43:57.926
Are you that busy?

43:59.219 --> 44:01.055
Uh, well…

44:04.600 --> 44:05.726
Now, tell me.

44:07.227 --> 44:09.355
What was that look on your face?

44:09.438 --> 44:10.481
What look?

44:10.564 --> 44:13.317
When I said earlier
that I couldn't reach Mr. Choi,

44:14.693 --> 44:16.862
this was the look on your face.

44:18.405 --> 44:20.282
That's just how I normally look.

44:20.366 --> 44:22.785
That's not true. I clearly saw it.

44:24.995 --> 44:27.039
What is it? Tell me.

44:27.122 --> 44:28.957
Do people know that he rejected me?

44:33.212 --> 44:36.298
It's more like
you're the one who's telling people.

44:36.382 --> 44:40.219
Then do they all know that we're
simply acting like the rumors are true?

44:40.302 --> 44:42.971
Sorry, but that's pretty much
what you're telling me right now.

44:43.847 --> 44:46.517
Then do they also know
that Mr. Choi likes Ms. Kook?

44:48.060 --> 44:49.561
I guess they do.

44:51.063 --> 44:52.690
Could he not hide it any better?

44:53.816 --> 44:55.067
You're telling me you knew?

44:55.150 --> 44:57.361
Then they'll soon know
that the feelings are mutual.

44:59.697 --> 45:01.448
I see you seem to know a lot of things.

45:03.784 --> 45:05.369
So do you want anything else?

45:05.452 --> 45:08.080
Excuse me, can we get
a bottle of beer and soju?

45:08.163 --> 45:08.997
Sure.

45:09.081 --> 45:11.417
That order's for me.
You can order for yourself.

45:13.293 --> 45:15.170
We can't be sober for this conversation.

45:19.675 --> 45:22.553
Tell me, how did you know
that I'd be there today?

45:22.636 --> 45:25.723
Someone from your team told me.
It was Ye-in, I think.

45:26.348 --> 45:28.434
What made you want to contact her?

45:28.517 --> 45:30.144
She called me first.

45:30.227 --> 45:31.311
For what reason?

45:31.937 --> 45:35.232
She was the only person
who asked if the scandal was true.

45:36.191 --> 45:38.485
Oh, those rumors, eh?

45:43.490 --> 45:47.786
Well. I'm sure you already know,
but it wasn't true.

45:53.083 --> 45:56.086
Isn't it funny? That it was
all because I know a celebrity.

45:56.170 --> 45:57.004
Huh.

45:59.465 --> 46:01.091
- But…
- Mm?

46:01.759 --> 46:04.219
- …the photos were real.
- What?

46:05.304 --> 46:08.474
I didn't know you were close enough
to go over to her house.

46:09.266 --> 46:11.810
Hold on. I'm sure you could tell
by the photos,

46:11.894 --> 46:13.687
but I only went in front of her house.

46:13.771 --> 46:15.981
Who knows?
No one could take photos inside.

46:16.064 --> 46:19.693
It's true, though. I was invited to go
inside but I turned it down in the end.

46:20.486 --> 46:22.154
She invited you inside?

46:23.030 --> 46:26.116
She also invited Eun-ho, I think.

46:26.200 --> 46:28.786
So she invited you over.

46:28.869 --> 46:31.371
Hold on.
Is that really important right now?

46:32.122 --> 46:36.084
You see, it wasn't before.
But now I'm not so sure.

46:36.668 --> 46:38.962
Wait, wait, wait.

46:42.800 --> 46:43.675
We're here.

46:43.759 --> 46:46.470
Wait, don't go and make this seem awkward.

46:47.054 --> 46:48.013
Hey.

46:49.223 --> 46:51.725
Oh look, you're in front
of another woman's house.

46:51.809 --> 46:52.726
Come on.

46:52.810 --> 46:55.145
Looks like you do this often.
You've really changed.

46:55.229 --> 46:56.480
That's enough.

46:57.689 --> 46:59.733
Do you know what it is
that I hate the most right now?

46:59.817 --> 47:00.859
What?

47:00.943 --> 47:02.569
We're not students anymore, you know.

47:04.071 --> 47:06.323
You don't have to go home early.

47:08.033 --> 47:09.409
Come back outside.

47:15.499 --> 47:16.959
Come here.

47:17.042 --> 47:18.710
It's still too early to go home.

47:18.794 --> 47:20.420
Got that? You can't go.

47:22.422 --> 47:24.675
Who's there outside?

47:24.758 --> 47:25.926
Yeon-su?

47:27.886 --> 47:32.099
Who would still be up at this hour?
Good for nothing brats.

47:42.943 --> 47:43.986
Would you like to…

47:47.614 --> 47:50.325
- come over for some jujube tea?
- What?

47:50.409 --> 47:51.994
I'm being serious.

47:52.077 --> 47:54.246
I want to get rid of all of that…

47:54.329 --> 47:55.372
I mean…

47:56.373 --> 47:57.249
Let's have some together.

48:02.212 --> 48:04.298
Pick it up. It's okay.

48:18.061 --> 48:21.940
Or do you want to go see
something lame with me?

48:24.109 --> 48:27.487
And at the very least I saw it coming,

48:27.571 --> 48:31.742
I knew about it somehow,
deep inside, so I wasn't that shocked.

48:37.372 --> 48:38.206
Thanks.

48:47.049 --> 48:48.175
The thing is,

48:49.051 --> 48:53.430
I didn't really see any harm
in having a crush

48:53.513 --> 48:55.390
since I never had one before.

48:55.933 --> 48:57.768
But now that I do,

48:57.851 --> 49:00.479
I would feel motivated
every single morning

49:00.562 --> 49:04.232
and become hopeful
even over the tiniest of things.

49:05.108 --> 49:09.071
It makes me feel as if
I'm really special inside.

49:10.948 --> 49:14.576
On top of that,
my imagination started going wild.

49:14.660 --> 49:16.954
I even thought about becoming a writer.

49:17.037 --> 49:20.374
And I actually thought
it was my true calling.

49:22.292 --> 49:26.004
This all came to me
after I started having a crush on him.

49:27.714 --> 49:30.133
So how great do you think that is?

49:42.521 --> 49:43.522
No way!

49:44.022 --> 49:46.900
This feeling I have for him
honestly sucks!

49:46.984 --> 49:49.194
How could he make me feel so miserable?

49:52.114 --> 49:54.700
I feel like a worthless person

49:54.783 --> 49:57.995
who had the audacity
to come between their grand love.

49:59.496 --> 50:01.748
Do you get what I mean, Mr. Kim?

50:07.170 --> 50:09.715
It's so annoying that I gave up like that.

50:13.468 --> 50:15.512
I take back what I just said.

50:16.972 --> 50:17.973
I know.

50:19.850 --> 50:21.101
Know what?

50:22.853 --> 50:24.563
That I can't give up on him?

50:26.898 --> 50:28.817
So annoying.

50:28.900 --> 50:31.403
Oh? Don't get me wrong.

50:31.486 --> 50:32.738
I'm don't mean you.

50:32.821 --> 50:36.575
I'm talking about
this dumb situation that I'm in.

50:42.539 --> 50:43.832
It'll get better.

50:46.626 --> 50:48.086
Having a crush on someone

50:49.671 --> 50:51.715
can be really hard at first.

50:51.798 --> 50:53.383
After a while,

50:54.468 --> 50:55.802
it gets even worse.

50:57.179 --> 50:58.138
Eventually…

50:59.514 --> 51:01.475
it becomes really unbearable.

51:02.476 --> 51:03.643
After that…

51:05.854 --> 51:07.564
you kind of just get used to it.

51:08.648 --> 51:11.902
Does that mean
that one day I'll be able to give up?

51:12.527 --> 51:13.487
No.

51:15.739 --> 51:19.242
You get used to the pain. So used to it…

51:20.619 --> 51:22.496
that you eventually become numb…

51:24.706 --> 51:28.335
and the pain doesn't even hurt anymore.

51:31.963 --> 51:33.090
Then…

51:35.592 --> 51:38.136
when does it finally stop?

51:40.555 --> 51:41.932
Well…

51:46.228 --> 51:48.021
I hadn't thought of that.

51:49.606 --> 51:53.151
Having a crush sucks big time.

51:59.825 --> 52:01.493
Thanks a lot

52:01.576 --> 52:05.539
for helping me to come to my senses.

52:14.881 --> 52:18.260
The gallery at this hour?
Isn't it closed?

52:18.343 --> 52:19.803
It won't take very long. I promise.

52:23.181 --> 52:25.433
Wait. You have the entrance card?

52:29.855 --> 52:30.939
Would you like to come in?

52:42.534 --> 52:45.662
Is this where you'll be holding
your solo exhibition?

52:45.745 --> 52:46.621
Mm.

52:47.831 --> 52:52.294
Oh. I really forgot about
what a great artist you are.

52:52.377 --> 52:53.253
Mr. Choi.

52:55.922 --> 52:59.384
Although, why did you
have to come here at this hour?

53:00.010 --> 53:03.388
Mm… I was actually thinking of holding
a nighttime exhibition.

53:03.471 --> 53:04.556
Late at night?

53:04.639 --> 53:07.475
Mm. It'll last through the entire night.

53:08.852 --> 53:12.647
I doubt many people will come
if it's being held too late.

53:12.731 --> 53:14.858
Promoting it won't be easy either.

53:14.941 --> 53:17.319
That's why my idea keeps getting rejected.

53:18.778 --> 53:22.574
I guess artists really do
think differently from us normal people.

53:23.783 --> 53:25.202
But seriously, why at this hour?

53:26.578 --> 53:29.789
Because it's the same time
when I drew all of them.

53:29.873 --> 53:31.041
And plus…

53:32.918 --> 53:35.045
it's also when I'm always awake.

54:23.760 --> 54:24.886
Just now,

54:26.304 --> 54:29.641
I imagined the time you spent
up alone at this hour.

54:31.309 --> 54:32.811
It must have been lonely.

54:36.398 --> 54:39.484
What goes through your mind
when you're drawing?

54:43.905 --> 54:45.240
What do you think about

54:46.658 --> 54:49.536
in that long span of time, Ung?

54:52.789 --> 54:53.623
I'm not sure.

54:54.958 --> 54:56.501
I never really thought about it.

54:59.296 --> 55:03.091
But I think nothing could ever be
as perfect as this.

55:14.436 --> 55:17.772
Every thin line that I drew…

55:19.357 --> 55:20.608
Every second

55:21.776 --> 55:23.069
that went by…

55:31.411 --> 55:32.912
Every year…

55:37.584 --> 55:38.960
Every moment…

55:41.629 --> 55:44.883
Yeon-su was always there, always present.

55:48.636 --> 55:49.763
What imagination?

55:51.473 --> 55:52.974
And from now on…

56:00.940 --> 56:02.484
I will spend all my time…

56:11.034 --> 56:13.161
loving Kook Yeon-su.

56:29.677 --> 56:30.887
Shall we go home?

56:32.889 --> 56:33.723
Mm.

57:15.932 --> 57:17.100
EPILOGUE

57:29.654 --> 57:32.407
If there truly is
an end to this crush,

57:33.741 --> 57:36.369
I hope that it comes to an end right now.

58:07.484 --> 58:10.153
Huh, your fever's gone. I'm leaving now.

58:10.236 --> 58:12.113
I told you to leave earlier, didn't I?

58:16.993 --> 58:18.786
What is it? You have more to say?

58:22.999 --> 58:25.627
Hey, do you want to move in with me?

58:25.710 --> 58:26.836
Huh?

58:26.920 --> 58:31.466
Your place kind of feels a bit lonely.

58:33.510 --> 58:35.053
Cut the nonsense and go.

58:35.136 --> 58:36.679
Oh. Thank goodness.

58:37.472 --> 58:39.307
I was worried you'd say yes.

58:40.850 --> 58:41.935
Rest up.

58:42.519 --> 58:44.729
Okay? You should always sleep at home.

58:45.480 --> 58:47.690
And that includes my place too.

58:52.529 --> 58:54.531
I'm so sick and tired of it.

58:57.158 --> 59:00.620
Of always… being the bad guy.

59:03.248 --> 59:10.255
BEGIN AGAIN

59:30.900 --> 59:34.237
You know what?
I want to keep living in this world.

59:34.862 --> 59:38.241
Biggest misfortune always comes
disguised as happiness.

59:38.324 --> 59:39.742
It's nothing, really.

59:40.743 --> 59:42.870
Let's just ignore everything for now.

59:44.080 --> 59:45.415
I'm not going to be friends with you.

59:45.915 --> 59:47.917
How are you going to end it?

59:48.001 --> 59:51.045
Hey Ji-ung… Why aren't you looking at me?

59:51.921 --> 59:54.257
I don't get
why you're seeing Yeon-su again.

59:54.340 --> 59:56.926
They say couples who fight
and break up often…

59:57.010 --> 59:59.053
What are you doing, Yeon-su?

59:59.137 --> 01:00:01.097
…have a higher chance
of breaking up again.
